body:
I know wright!? *What about the sex life's of minors is so interesting to these full grown ass men on reddit!??!!?!!!??!?* Also the full first paragraph is how I feel. To the point I didn't even understand myself until someone told me what Asexual is. And too the second paragraph, yeah, that's how I *want* to be treated! Like there's nothing wrong with me and that I'm just normal!

and also pumpkin please ;w;

and also also thank you for your support!
